      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Sometimes a State executive agency or legislative committee writes directly to a City agency requesting the views of the City agency on pending or contemplated legislation. On occasion, State officials requests City officials to make a personal appearance before a joint legislative committee or a temporary State Commission.",
